  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "GeometryPass implements IRenderPass, managing the primary rendering sequence by drawing scene geometry. It orchestrates rendering in a specific order: opaque entities (nearest first), followed by the skybox, and finally transparent entities (farthest first). The class utilizes CameraUBO to manage view and projection matrices and interacts with the WebGL2RenderingContext to execute drawing operations based on the provided RenderContext frame data."
  },
